[
  {
    "content_id": "10036001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;亞們的兒子猶大王約西亞執政期間，耶和華的話傳給了希西迦的玄孫、亞瑪利亞的曾孫、基大利的孫子、古示的兒子西番雅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說： 「我必毀滅地上的一切。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我必毀滅人類、獸類、 天上的鳥和海裡的魚。 我必使惡人倒斃， 我必剷除地上的人類。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;「我必伸手攻擊猶大， 攻擊耶路撒冷的所有居民， 清除巴力的殘跡及拜偶像之祭司的名號。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我必剷除那些在屋頂祭拜天上萬象的人， 剷除敬拜耶和華並憑祂起誓又憑米勒公起誓的人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;剷除離棄耶和華、不尋求祂、不求問祂的人。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;要在主耶和華面前肅靜， 因為耶和華的日子近了。 耶和華已準備好祭物， 潔淨了祂邀請的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說：「在給耶和華獻祭之日， 我必懲罰首領和王子， 以及所有穿外族服裝的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;到那日，我必懲罰所有跳過門檻、 使主人的家充滿暴力和欺詐的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;到那日，魚門必傳出哭喊聲， 新區必響起哀號聲， 山陵必發出崩裂的巨響。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;市場區的居民啊，哀哭吧！ 因為所有的商人必滅亡， 所有做買賣的必被剷除。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;那時，我必提著燈巡察耶路撒冷， 懲罰那些安於罪中的人。 他們心想，『耶和華不賜福也不降禍。』</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他們的財物必遭搶掠， 家園必淪為廢墟。 他們建造房屋，卻不能住在裡面； 栽種葡萄園，卻喝不到葡萄酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;「耶和華的大日子近了， 近了，很快就到了。 那將是痛苦的日子， 勇士也必淒聲哀號。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;那是降烈怒的日子， 是困苦艱難的日子， 是摧殘毀壞的日子， 是黑暗幽冥的日子， 是陰霾密佈的日子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;是吹號吶喊、 攻打堅城高壘的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;「我要使災難臨到人類， 以致他們行路像瞎眼的， 因為他們得罪了耶和華。 他們的血必如灰塵般被倒出， 他們的屍體必如糞便般被丟棄。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;在耶和華發怒的日子， 他們的金銀救不了他們。 祂的怒火必吞噬大地， 祂必驟然毀滅一切世人。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:1-2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1-2</sup>&nbsp;不知羞恥的國民啊， 趁命令尚未發出、 日子尚未消逝如風中的糠秕、 耶和華的烈怒尚未臨到你們、 祂向你們發怒的日子尚未來臨， 要聚集，聚集起來！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;世上所有遵守耶和華典章的謙卑人啊， 要尋求耶和華，追求公義，追求謙卑。 也許在耶和華發怒的日子， 你們可以得到庇護。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;迦薩必被拋棄， 亞實基倫必淪為廢墟， 亞實突的居民必在中午被趕走， 以革倫必被連根拔除。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;住在海邊的基利提人啊， 你們有禍了！ 非利士人的迦南啊， 耶和華宣告要毀滅你， 使你杳無人煙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;沿海地區必成為草場， 有牧人的居所和羊圈。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;那裡必歸給猶大家的餘民， 他們必在那裡放牧， 晚上睡在亞實基倫的房屋裡， 因為他們的上帝耶和華必眷顧他們， 使他們回歸故土。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:8-9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8-9</sup>&nbsp;以色列的上帝——萬軍之耶和華說： 「我聽見了摩押人的譭謗和亞捫人的辱罵。 他們譭謗我的子民，揚言侵佔他們的土地。 我憑自己的永恆起誓， 摩押和亞捫必刺草叢生、鹽坑遍地、永遠荒廢， 如所多瑪和蛾摩拉一樣。 我餘下的子民必擄掠他們， 我倖存的百姓必承受他們的土地。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;這是他們的報應， 因為他們狂妄自大， 羞辱萬軍之耶和華的子民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和華必令他們恐懼， 因為祂要削弱世上的神明。 天下萬民必在本地敬拜祂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;古實人啊， 你們也必死在耶和華的刀下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;祂必伸手攻擊北方，毀滅亞述， 使尼尼微一片荒涼， 如乾旱的曠野。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;牲畜和野獸必躺臥在那裡， 貓頭鷹和刺蝟棲身在房柱上， 窗口傳出鳥鳴， 門庭都必破敗， 露出香柏木梁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;這就是那歡樂安逸、 自以為天下無雙的城， 現在竟然如此荒涼， 成為野獸棲息之地！ 路過的人都搖手嘲笑它。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;這叛逆、污穢、充滿壓迫的城有禍了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;她不聽命令，不受管教； 不倚靠耶和華， 不親近她的上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;她的首領是咆哮的獅子， 她的審判官是夜間的豺狼， 不留一點獵物到天明。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;她的先知狂妄詭詐， 她的祭司褻瀆聖殿，違背律法。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;但城中的耶和華是公義的， 祂絕不做不義之事。 祂每天早晨伸張正義，從不間斷。 然而，不義之人卻不知羞恥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;「我已消滅列國， 摧毀他們的城樓， 使他們的街道荒廢，沒有路人； 他們的城邑淪為廢墟，杳無人跡，沒有居民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我以為這城一定會敬畏我，接受管教， 這樣我就不必照所定的毀滅她的居所。 然而，他們卻更加熱衷於犯罪作惡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;「因此，要等候我， 等候我起來指控的日子。 我已決定召集列國，匯聚列邦， 向他們傾倒我的烈怒， 我的怒火必吞噬天下。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;「那時，我必潔淨萬民的口， 他們好求告我的名， 同心合意地事奉我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;那些敬拜我的， 就是我那些分散的子民必從古實河對岸帶著供物來獻給我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;到那天，你必不再因背叛我而羞愧， 因為那時我必除掉你那裡的狂傲之徒， 你在我的聖山上必不再高傲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我必把謙卑貧苦的人留在你那裡， 他們必投靠在耶和華的名下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;以色列的餘民必不再作惡， 不再撒謊，口中不再出詭詐之言。 他們吃喝躺臥，無人驚擾。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;少女錫安啊，歌唱吧！ 以色列啊，歡呼吧！ 少女耶路撒冷啊，盡情地歡喜快樂吧！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;耶和華已經撤銷對你的刑罰， 趕走你的仇敵， 以色列的王耶和華與你同在， 你必不再懼怕災禍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;到那天，耶路撒冷必聽到這樣的話： 「錫安啊，不要害怕！不要雙手發軟！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你的上帝耶和華與你同在， 祂是大能的拯救者， 祂必因你而歡喜快樂，歡然歌唱， 用祂的愛安慰你。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;「我必招聚你那裡因不能守節期而憂愁的人， 使你不再蒙受羞辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;看啊，那時我必懲罰所有欺壓你的人， 拯救瘸腿的，召回分散的， 使他們的羞辱化為尊榮，聲名遠揚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10036003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "西番雅書 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "36003020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;那時，我必招聚你們，帶你們回到故土。 你們親眼目睹我帶你們回到故土後， 我必使你們在天下萬民中聲名遠揚，得享尊榮。」 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  }
]